  "title": {
    "rendered": "Adjustable aluminum shelves"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://stathis.com.gr/en/truck-refrigerators/\">Back</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><br>Inclined and height-adjustable shelves made by Pommier-Furgocar</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The most advanced and functional solution in box shelving.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All system parts are made of anodized aluminium in order to meet all hygiene and cleanliness specifications inside the box. When open, shelves facilitate the arrangement of merchandise and ex-van sales. An important detail is that the last profile of each shelf protrudes in order to restrain the merchandise. This is also assisted by the slope of the shelves towards the wall of the box.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When transporting pallets, shelves are folded up so as to free up the entire space of the box.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Shelves fold up or down in the easiest possible way, increasing functionality Shelves are comprised of anodized aluminium profiles to enable the proper circulation of air around the products. Each support can carry a weight of 50kg when evenly distributed on the shelf.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There is also the option of ordering custom-built fittings tailored to the needs of the client.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1407\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_3156.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1407 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_3156.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_3156-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_3156-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1409\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_03920-768x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1409 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_03920-768x1024-1.jpg 768w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_03920-768x1024-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/1024;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1408\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_koukakis4.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1408 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_koukakis4.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_koukakis4-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_koukakis4-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_05034-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1413 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_05034-1.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_05034-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-rafia_05034-1-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n",
